# Pureza do domínio

`domain` is JVM Kotlin only.

```kotlin
// BAD
import android.content.Context
import androidx.room.Entity
import androidx.compose.runtime.Immutable

// GOOD
data class TaskId(val value: String)
class GenerateDayAgenda(private val clock: Clock) { /* ... */ }
```

- No Compose, Room, Resources, or `Context`
- Inject `Clock`; do not call `now()` on the system clock
- UI and data depend on domain, never the reverse
